      "poly": [
        138.62,
        195.62,
        528.33,
        195.62,
        528.33,
        252.74,
        138.62,
        252.74
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to circulate for the information\nof all Ministries of the Government of India a copy of the minutes\nrecorded by the Prime Minister relating to -"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 4,
      "poly": [
        162.84,
        264.75,
        489.0,
        264.75,
        489.0,
        309.39,
        162.84,
        309.39
      ],
      "text": "(1) The appointment of Shri R.R.Diwakar, Member of the\nConstituent Assembly, as Minister of State for\nInformation and Broadcasting with effect from the\n7th December, 1948."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        164.28,
        312.51,
        532.65,
        312.51,
        532.65,
        358.83,
        164.28,
        358.83
      ],
      "text": "(2) The appointment of Dr.Balkrishnan V.Keskar, Member of the\nConstituent Assembly, as Deputy Minister with effect\nfrom the 7th December, 1948. He will be attached to\nthe Ministry of External Affairs & Commonwealth Relations."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
